  "question": {
    "text": "Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>,</mo><mn>2022</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>. Then the probability, that a randomly chosen number&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math>&nbsp;from the set&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi></math>&nbsp;such that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>H</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>F</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>2022</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>, is",
    "image": null
  },
